---
import SiteLayout from "../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Cypress Christmas Lights | Lead Generation Funnel Case Study" description="How LeadsFlo built a residential and commercial Christmas lighting qualification, CRM, and appointment booking journey before Meta Ads launch." path="/work/cypress-christmas-lights/">
<article class="case-study">
<header class="case-hero"><div class="case-container">
<p class="case-kicker"><a href="/work/">Selected Work</a> / Home Services / Pre-launch</p>
<h1>Turning Christmas lighting inquiries into qualified design visits.</h1>
<p class="case-lede">For Cypress Christmas Lights, we built more than a landing page: a connected system that qualifies residential and commercial inquiries, routes leads into the CRM and moves prospects toward a free lighting design visit.</p>
<div class="case-tags"><span>Landing Page & Funnel</span><span>Interactive Qualification</span><span>CRM & Automation</span><span>Appointment Booking</span><span>Meta Ads: Pre-launch</span></div>
<div class="case-cta-actions"><a class="case-btn case-christmas-btn" href="/christmas-lighting-leads/">Explore Our Christmas Lighting Lead Generation System ↗</a><a class="case-btn" href="/contact/">Discuss a similar project ↗</a></div>
</div></header>
<section class="case-container"><figure class="case-media"><img src="/work/cypress-christmas-lights.webp" alt="Cypress Christmas Lights landing page showing the Christmas Lights Without the Work offer and interactive quote form" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>Custom landing page and interactive quote funnel for Cypress Christmas Lights.</figcaption></figure></section>
<section class="case-band"><div class="case-container"><div class="case-intro"><p class="case-overline">The challenge</p><h2>Paid traffic needed a system behind it.</h2><p>The business needed to communicate a full-service lighting offer quickly, filter poor-fit inquiries, collect project details and help qualified prospects book a design visit—without relying on manual lead handling. The funnel had to serve both residential and commercial projects, with residential pricing starting at $800.</p></div>
<div class="case-grid case-grid-three">
<div class="case-card"><span class="case-n">01 / POSITIONING</span><h3>Christmas lights. Without the work.</h3><p>The page communicates design, commercial-grade lighting, installation, maintenance, takedown and storage, while addressing DIY effort and seasonal hassle.</p></div>
<div class="case-card"><span class="case-n">02 / QUALIFICATION</span><h3>Context before contact.</h3><p>A multi-step quote experience captures decorating areas, preferred style, property type, budget and contact/property information.</p></div>
<div class="case-card"><span class="case-n">03 / BOOKING</span><h3>From inquiry to design visit.</h3><p>The funnel gives qualified prospects a direct route to a free Christmas lighting design visit without entering their contact details again.</p></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="case-band case-alt"><div class="case-container"><p class="case-overline">Customer journey</p><h2>One connected conversion path.</h2><div class="case-flow"><span>Meta Ad</span><b>→</b><span>Landing Page</span><b>→</b><span>Quote Questions</span><b>→</b><span>CRM & Lead Routing</span><b>→</b><span>Design Visit</span><b>→</b><span>Follow-up</span></div><p class="case-note">Meta creative and acquisition campaigns are prepared for launch; this flow describes the configured funnel, not measured campaign conversions.</p></div></section>
<section class="case-band"><div class="case-container"><p class="case-overline">Behind the scenes</p><h2>The operational system we built.</h2><div class="case-grid">
<div class="case-card"><span class="case-n">CRM & PIPELINE</span><h3>Every inquiry has a record.</h3><p>GoHighLevel creates or updates contacts, stores property and lighting preferences, tags the funnel/source, creates opportunities, assigns owners and routes budget segments into appropriate follow-up paths.</p></div>
<div class="case-card"><span class="case-n">EMAIL FOLLOW-UP</span><h3>Bring unfinished inquiries back.</h3><p>Branded email journeys include immediate confirmation, a 24-hour follow-up and a final booking reminder, with separate messaging for prospects below the primary residential budget.</p></div>
<div class="case-card"><span class="case-n">SMS WORKFLOWS</span><h3>Built, pending activation.</h3><p>An SMS follow-up sequence is configured with booking-stop logic, to be activated after required A2P registration and approvals. We are not presenting it as live.</p></div>
<div class="case-card"><span class="case-n">APPOINTMENT AUTOMATION</span><h3>Communications tied to the visit.</h3><p>Appointment confirmation and reminders are designed around booking-relative timing, with reschedule/cancellation paths and suppression of quote-booking outreach once a visit is scheduled.</p></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="case-band case-alt"><div class="case-container"><p class="case-overline">Paid acquisition</p><h2>Creative ready for Meta Ads.</h2><p class="case-intro">Planned campaign angles cover residential before-and-after transformations, professional installation versus DIY, full-service convenience, $800 starting-price qualification, commercial projects and Cypress-area relevance.</p><div class="case-card"><h3>Campaign status: Pre-launch</h3><p>No lead volume, cost per lead, appointment-booking rate or paid-media return is claimed. Performance can be added once campaigns launch and sufficient tracked data is available.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="case-footer"><div class="case-container"><p class="case-overline">The principle</p><h2>Build the follow-through before buying the traffic.</h2><p>Need a landing page, lead qualification, CRM routing and a booking journey that work together?</p><div class="case-cta-actions"><a class="case-btn case-christmas-btn" href="/christmas-lighting-leads/">Explore the Christmas Lighting System ↗</a><a class="case-btn" href="/contact/">Discuss your project ↗</a></div><div><a class="case-back" href="/work/">← All selected work</a></div></div></section>
</article>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
.case-study{--case-ink:#17233d;--case-blue:#315bfa;--case-muted:#52617a;color:var(--case-ink)}
.case-study .case-container{width:min(1150px,calc(100% - 40px));margin-inline:auto}
.case-study .case-hero{padding:clamp(65px,7vw,108px) 0 58px}
.case-study .case-kicker{color:var(--case-blue);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 20px}
.case-study h1{font-size:clamp(43px,5vw,76px);letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:1.05;max-width:980px;margin:0 0 24px}
.case-study .case-lede{font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,23px);line-height:1.6;color:var(--case-muted);max-width:860px;margin:0 0 25px}
.case-study .case-tags{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:22px 0 28px}
.case-study .case-tags span{background:#e8edfb;color:#273962;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:99px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
.case-study .case-btn{background:#315bfa;color:#fff!important;padding:15px 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;display:inline-flex;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px}
.case-study .case-btn:hover{background:#203ecd}
.case-study .case-media{background:#e9eef8;border:1px solid #dce4f2;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 25px 60px rgba(23,35,61,.09)}
.case-study .case-media img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
.case-study figure{margin:0}
.case-study figcaption{font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#67748a;padding:12px 16px}
.case-study .case-band{padding:clamp(58px,7vw,100px) 0}
.case-study .case-alt{background:#f1f5ff}
.case-study .case-intro{max-width:790px;margin-bottom:28px}
.case-study .case-overline{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;color:#315bfa}
.case-study h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3.8vw,52px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0 20px}
.case-study h3{font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 10px}
.case-study p,.case-study li{line-height:1.75;color:#4f5f79}
.case-study .case-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:22px}
.case-study .case-grid-three{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}
.case-study .case-card{padding:27px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe3f0;border-radius:14px}
.case-study .case-card p{margin:0}
.case-study .case-n{color:#315bfa;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:15px;display:block}
.case-study .case-flow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center}
.case-study .case-flow span{padding:13px 17px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6dff0;border-radius:9px;font-size:14px;font-weight:800}
.case-study .case-flow b{color:#315bfa}
.case-study .case-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin:25px 0}
.case-study .case-stat{background:#17233d;color:#fff;padding:25px 18px;border-radius:12px}
.case-study .case-stat strong{display:block;font-size:clamp(25px,3vw,42px);line-height:1.1;color:#c9f36b;letter-spacing:-.04em}
.case-study .case-stat span{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#d9e2f6}
.case-study .case-note{font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#596a85;margin-top:18px}
.case-study .case-list{padding-left:22px}
.case-study .case-list li{margin-bottom:9px}
.case-study .case-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:42px;align-items:center}
.case-study .case-footer{background:#17233d;color:#fff;padding:75px 0}
.case-study .case-footer h2,.case-study .case-footer p{color:#fff}
.case-study .case-footer p{color:#c5d0e6}
.case-study .case-back{display:inline-block;margin-top:22px;color:#315bfa;font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:760px){.case-study .case-container{width:min(100% - 28px,1150px)}.case-study .case-hero{padding:50px 0}.case-study .case-grid,.case-study .case-grid-three,.case-study .case-stats,.case-study .case-split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.case-study .case-flow{gap:6px}.case-study .case-flow span{font-size:12px;padding:10px}.case-study .case-card{padding:22px}}
</style>


<!-- LF_CYPRESS_CHRISTMAS_CTA_V1 -->
<style>
.case-study .case-cta-actions {
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  align-items:center;
  gap:12px;
}

.case-study .case-christmas-btn {
  background:#315bfa;
  color:#fff!important;
  border:1px solid #315bfa;
  line-height:1.5;
  transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease,background .25s ease;
}

.case-study .case-christmas-btn:hover {
  background:#203ecd;
  transform:translateY(-3px);
  box-shadow:0 12px 25px rgba(23,78,66,.2);
}

.case-study .case-christmas-btn:focus-visible {
  outline:3px solid #315bfa;
  outline-offset:3px;
}

@media(max-width:600px) {
  .case-study .case-cta-actions {
    align-items:stretch;
    flex-direction:column;
  }

  .case-study .case-cta-actions .case-btn {
    justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;
  }
}

@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
  .case-study .case-christmas-btn {
    transition:none;
  }

  .case-study .case-christmas-btn:hover {
    transform:none;
  }
}
</style>

<style>
.case-study .case-cta-actions .case-btn:not(.case-christmas-btn) {
  background:transparent;
  border:1px solid #17233d;
  color:#17233d!important;
}

.case-study .case-cta-actions .case-btn:not(.case-christmas-btn):hover {
  background:#17233d;
  color:#fff!important;
}
</style>
